      "message": "Patch Set 1:\n\n(1 comment)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nLooks good. The folded hint check is equivalent to the old if/else-if, the `out` label and `ss` are still used, and nothing else in the tree references OBD_FAIL_MDS_STALE_DIR_LAYOUT, fail_loc 0x158, or sanity 300l. One commit-message point inline; no need to re-spin the code for it.",
